    "updated_at": "2026-02-01T20:00:17Z",
    "body": "This is actually already tested in various WPT tests: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/webstorage/event_basic.html\n\nLadybird happens to fail this because of the lazy initialization.\n\nI was considering changing things to iterate over every Window instead in broadcast (and initializing the storage object there), but that runs into the opposite problem of iterating over Window objects which are not fully initialized yet.",
